Synthetic frames and REST answers (decision 0009). Nothing in this directory belongs to a funded
account.

resting.frames is hand-built: its two order events are fixtures/paradex/exec's
order-closed-filled-v2 and order-closed-canceled-v2 with the conformance suite's client ids 6
and 7 (namespace 1) and made-up venue ids put in; its resync answers are in the shapes of
fixtures/paradex/exec's rest-orders-open.json and rest-positions.json, with the suite's client
ids 8 and 5, a random version-4 UUID for the Java-era order, made-up venue ids, prices and
times, and the account 0xa0a1..bf, 32 made-up bytes, as every fixtures/paradex/exec frame has.
